.agents/specs/spec-minimum.md-72-- Server, daemon, operator UI, notifications, approvals loop (full spec).
.agents/specs/spec-minimum.md-73-- Concurrency: exactly one run per process invocation; no locking (review G9).
.agents/specs/spec-minimum.md-74-- Checkpoint/restore of sandboxes.
.agents/specs/spec-minimum.md-75-- NATS/event-bus federation, SeaCell, dynamic plugin loading, adapter installation, and DomainForge projection beyond the stub `.sea` format in §11. The slice still defines extension/projection descriptor fields so those capabilities can arrive without record migration.
