.agents/specs/spec-minimum.md-736-- The implementation MUST create the workspace at `<run_dir>/workspace/` and run the command with `cwd` inside it.
.agents/specs/spec-minimum.md-737-- The implementation MUST apply the path-safety algorithm (§16.1) to every `write_file` target and to artifact collection paths.
.agents/specs/spec-minimum.md-738-- The implementation MUST pass a minimal environment (§7.3.6) and MUST NOT inherit the parent environment wholesale.
.agents/specs/spec-minimum.md-739-- The implementation MUST enforce the timeout by killing the child process and recording `timed_out`.
